color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-25T10:02:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T16:14:39Z","closed_at":"2025-07-25T16:13:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600KF (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `DirAccess.get_space_left()` method appears to always return the free space of the disk where the *project executable* resides, rather than the disk space of the directory referenced by the `DirAccess` instance.\n\nAccording to the documentation:\n\n> \"Returns the available space on the current directory's disk, in bytes.\"\n\nI interpreted \"current directory\" as the one the `DirAccess` instance points to, which seems more intuitive. However, the return value seems unrelated to the instance path.\n\n```gdscript\nvar dir := DirAccess.open(\"D:\\\\\")\t\t\nprint(\"current drive:\", DirAccess.get_drive_name(dir.get_current_drive()))\nprint(\"space left: %.2f GB\" % (dir.get_space_left() / 1024.0 / 1024.0 / 1024.0)) # returns project executable drive's free space\n\ndir.change_dir(\"C:\\\\\")\nprint(\"current drive:\", DirAccess.get_drive_name(dir.get_current_drive()))\nprint(\"space left: %.2f GB\" % (dir.get_space_left() / 1024.0 / 1024.0 / 1024.0)) # still returns project executable drive's free space\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nI expected the method to return the free space of the disk corresponding to the path set on the `DirAccess` instance.\n\n### Suggestions\n\nIf the current behavior is intended, it may be worth:\n\n- Clarifying the documentation more explicitly.\n\n- Considering making this a static method, as the result doesn't depend on the instance's state.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a `DirAccess` instance pointing to a different drive or directory.\n\n2. Call get_space_left() on the instance.\n\n3. Observe that it still returns the free space of the directory containing the executable.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n`N/A`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108966/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}